@startuml 架构组件图
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title 校园二手交易系统 — 软件架构组件图 (Component Diagram)

package "表现层 (手机端 H5)" as UI {
    [商品大厅/搜索] as UI1
    [商品详情] as UI2
    [发布商品/草稿] as UI3
    [个人中心] as UI4
    [我的预约/订单] as UI5
    [管理员审核后台] as UI6
}

package "API 接口层 (REST)" as API {
    [AuthController] as C_AUTH
    [ItemController] as C_ITEM
    [OrderController] as C_ORDER
    [FavoriteController] as C_FAV
    [AdminController] as C_ADMIN
}

package "业务服务层" as SVC {
    [用户与认证服务] as S_USER
    [商品状态机服务] as S_ITEM
    [预约订单服务] as S_ORDER
    [审核与申诉服务] as S_AUDIT
    [收藏服务] as S_FAV
    [通知服务] as S_NOTIFY
    [操作日志服务] as S_LOG
}

package "定时任务层" as CRON {
    [48h 超时取消任务] as J_TIMEOUT
    [24h 异议结算任务] as J_DISPUTE
    [审核超期预警] as J_SLA
}

package "数据层" as DB {
    database "MySQL\n(user/item/order/favorite/log)" as DB_MYSQL
    queue "对象存储\n(商品图片)" as DB_OSS
}

UI1 --> C_ITEM
UI2 --> C_ITEM
UI2 --> C_ORDER
UI3 --> C_ITEM
UI4 --> C_ORDER
UI4 --> C_FAV
UI5 --> C_ORDER
UI6 --> C_ADMIN

C_AUTH --> S_USER
C_ITEM --> S_ITEM
C_ORDER --> S_ORDER
C_FAV --> S_FAV
C_ADMIN --> S_AUDIT

S_USER --> DB_MYSQL
S_ITEM --> DB_MYSQL
S_ITEM --> DB_OSS
S_ORDER --> DB_MYSQL
S_FAV --> DB_MYSQL
S_AUDIT --> DB_MYSQL
S_LOG --> DB_MYSQL

S_ITEM --> S_LOG : 写日志
S_ORDER --> S_LOG : 写日志
S_AUDIT --> S_LOG : 写日志
S_ORDER --> S_NOTIFY : 推送通知
S_AUDIT --> S_NOTIFY : 推送通知

J_TIMEOUT --> S_ORDER : 扫描超时订单
J_DISPUTE --> S_ORDER : 扫描待结算订单
J_SLA --> S_AUDIT : 标记超期审核
@enduml
